# PlatformIO: toolchains and build products are large and machine-specific.
# platformio.ini and src/ ARE tracked — the build must be reproducible from the repo,
# but the ~200 MB of downloaded AVR toolchain and the .elf/.hex outputs must not be.
.pio/

